# =============================================================================
# SYSTEM INITIALIZATION
# =============================================================================
# This file handles the initial system setup and minimization:
# - Random displacements to avoid exact overlaps
# - Energy minimization to resolve bad contacts
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Initial energy computation with safer settings
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Add a temporary NVE fix during initialization to prevent warnings
# fix             temp_nve all nve/noforce

# First compute the initial energy with diagnostics
# thermo          1
# thermo_style    custom step atoms pe ke temp press vol
# run             0

# Remove the temporary fix
# unfix           temp_nve

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Perform careful minimization
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fix to prevent system drift
# fix             fe all momentum 100 linear 1 1 1 angular

# Add small random displacements to avoid exact overlaps
# displace_atoms  all random 0.01 0.01 0.01 ${seed} units box

# First, very gentle minimization to handle bad overlaps
# minimize        1.0e-3 1.0e-4 1000 10000

# Then, more thorough minimization
# minimize        1.0e-4 1.0e-6 5000 50000

# Unfix the momentum fix
# unfix           fe

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Apply additional safety check
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Delete any atoms that may have strayed outside the box
# region          safety block 0 ${Lx} 0 ${Ly} 0 ${H} units box
# group           inside region safety
# group           outside subtract all inside
# delete_atoms    group outside

# Add temporary NVE fix for final energy calculation
# fix             temp_nve2 all nve/noforce

# Final energy calculation to verify system is stable
# run             0

# Remove temporary fix
# unfix           temp_nve2
